  "Message": "feat(uploads): implement song upload and delete functionality\n\n* feat(uploads): implement song upload and delete functionality\n\nUpload system:\n- Add uploadSong API with progress tracking\n- Support mp3, m4a, wma, flac, ogg formats (max 300MB)\n- Upload UI with progress dialog and cancel button\n- Upload from Library Songs and Uploaded playlist screens\n\nDelete uploaded songs:\n- Add delete API using correct entityId format (t_po_...)\n- Parse uploadEntityId from confirmDialogEndpoint in menu response\n- Show confirmation dialog before deleting\n- Remove from local database on successful delete\n\nDatabase \u0026 sync:\n- Add uploadEntityId column (migration 34-\u003e35)\n- Sync uploadEntityId from YouTube Music\n- Clear uploadEntityId on logout\n\n* feat: add bulk delete for uploaded songs\n\nAdd option to delete multiple uploaded songs at once from the\nselection menu in the uploaded playlist screen.",
