  "Message": "feat(player): add WEB_REMIX streaming with PoToken and n-transform support\n\n* feat(player): add WEB_REMIX streaming with PoToken and n-transform support\n\n- Add PoToken generation for WEB_REMIX client authentication\n- Implement n-transform solver for throttle parameter handling\n- Add cipher deobfuscation for stream URL processing\n- Update player API to pass poToken in serviceIntegrityDimensions\n- Add ProGuard rules for WebView JavaScript interfaces\n\n* fix(player): add WEB_CREATOR fallback for age-restricted content\n\n- Use WEB_CREATOR client for age-restricted videos (works with login)\n- Skip NewPipe methods for age-restricted content (doesn't support auth)\n- Add custom cipher deobfuscation fallback for stream URLs\n- Remove noisy stack trace logging from NewPipe errors\n- Keep normal content flow unchanged (signature timestamp + poToken)",
